 <a id="known-limitations-and-deferred-work"></a>
 
-- **Automatic selection reads only the deployment composition** — a menu offers it when the composition layer sets no provider for that capability. While automatic selection applies, the Host's `DSH_WEB_SEARCH_PROVIDER` or `DSH_WEB_FETCH_PROVIDER` environment variable picks the provider instead, and the page does not show that choice. Without either, automatic Fetch selection with more than one usable registered provider makes each operation fail with `WEB_PROVIDER_AMBIGUOUS`, and so does automatic Search selection when the Host does not register the DeepSeek provider it prefers for the conversation's model. The line under automatic Search selection is fixed copy that describes the Host with both DeepSeek search providers registered.
